title: "MEIDNet: Multimodal Equivariant Inverse Design Network"
abstract: "Inverse design of crystalline materials from target properties: one shared latent space for crystal structures and their properties, a prototype-family design space with chemistry rules, and a latent search that proposes candidates. MEIDNet Prism is the interactive platform around it."
